


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_a83476dc:


    "夜已深沉，人已上床——"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_3a0daac3:


    "除了某一张床。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_01fcf6af:



    voice "2FU_1315"
    fumi "「——今天也是美好的一天」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_bd22b350:


    "文在自己床上安静地合上了日记本。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_4eeff306:



