translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_4b0ed23b:



    voice "2HI_1624"
    hina "「今晚是住在那边的房间？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_fe081685:


    "圣夜子的床是空的，但大家似乎都对她在哪里过夜有头绪。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_298c5d4f:


    "她们仨之后继续待在各自床上远距离传话，但三人都祝福着圣夜子与祥子的happy end。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_dcea7feb:



    voice "2RI_1723"
    rin "「圣夜夜明天早上起得来吗～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_14_d19b2fd7:



    voice "2HI_1625"
    hina "「喂」"
